## What this version is not

Lévis, Laval, exo, REM, and the Québec–Montréal corridor are out on purpose. Native iOS / iPad / Watch can wrap this same atlas once the web map is the source of truth. I did not fake a full WebGPU map engine: tiles are GPU-drawn with MapLibre, and the UI reports WebGPU when the browser has it.

If you want the next cut, the useful order is: **daytime trip QA in the browser**, then **STLévis**, then a thin iPhone shell.

