**How this extends to any city.** What we built is not “Québec code” and “Montréal code.” It is one GTFS/GBFS machine with a city file.

1. **One ingest, many cities.** `scripts/ingest-gtfs.mjs` already turns any official GTFS zip into the same atlas: stops, routes, shapes, timetable, calendar. RTC and STM only differ by URL and attribution. That list now lives in `src/lib/registry.json`. A new city is another object: id, timezone, center, GTFS URL, optional GBFS URL.

